    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In April, ELE_net offered AKU Students the opportunity to improve their Academic Speaking Skills by participating in live classes conducted on the Zoom platform. Students who enrolled for these weekly sessions came from different AKU programmes and campuses, including Pakistan, Tanzania and Kenya. Each 90-minute session supported students in developing their academic language through a range of interactive online activities and engaging discussions.",
